            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które z tych porównań daje wynik <code>True</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Porównanie za pomocą <code>==</code> powinno dać wynik <code>True</code>. Które porównanie go daje?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" = \"apple\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
