            "id": 76776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przechowaj ciąg znaków <code>\"high\"</code> w <code>my_answer</code>, aby porównanie dało wynik <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"high\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Porównanie ma wynik <code>False</code> tylko wtedy, gdy dwa ciągi znaków nie są równe.</p><p>Zapisz <code>\"high\"</code> w <code>my_answer</code> i wykonaj porównanie, aby kod wyświetlił <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"high\"</code>, a następnie <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
